{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "request",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Describe the goal\n\nOrdinary request or evolvebook brief.\n\nThe router chooses a suitable workflow."
    },
    {
      "id": "plan",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Plan and prerequisites\n\nDefine scope, success criteria and dependencies.\n\nResolve material questions and required design approval."
    },
    {
      "id": "foundation",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 460,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Build and verify foundation\n\nScoped builder creates prerequisite contracts.\n\nRequired checks must pass before dependent work starts."
    },
    {
      "id": "feature",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Build the feature\n\nFresh context and explicit file ownership.\n\nIndependent tasks may run in parallel."
    },
    {
      "id": "gates",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## Behavior / visual / code\n\nObserved checks and independent findings.\n\nRequired failures and unknowns block acceptance."
    },
    {
      "id": "human",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1150,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## User acceptance\n\nAccept this specific result.\n\nCommit, push, merge and deployment permissions remain distinct."
    },
    {
      "id": "state",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 570,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## Run state: the notebook\n\nGoal, scope, task status, prerequisites, blockers and next action.\n\nOne authoritative record; updates survive interrupted chats."
    },
    {
      "id": "evidence",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 570,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## Evidence: the proof\n\nTests, screenshots, review findings and explicit acceptance.\n\nCode changes reopen checks whose proof is stale."
    },
    {
      "id": "ui",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 570,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Brief / progress / review\n\nFriendly view of the same record.\n\nFinished and Still not done lists, including blockers and next actions."
    },
    {
      "id": "blocked",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -480,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "## Bounded review loop\n\nInitial review plus at most two fix/re-review rounds.\n\nIf blockers remain, show unresolved issues and options."
    },
    {
      "id": "status",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 570,
      "y": 1150,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "## Implementation status\n\nProposed architecture. Existing skills and installer are available.\n\nIntegrated run engine, dashboard and npm release remain planned."
    }
  ],
